contentText:
Looks like Journey almost went their separate ways two years ago.

In a new statement posted to Facebook on Monday, Journey co-founder and lead guitarist Neal Schon seemingly replied to frontman Arnel Pineda &#8216;s claims that he was prohibited from quitting the band twice.

